---
// The Start here guide: how to get the app and run it on your own Windows computer.
// It is used on the home page (hidden, and shown only on the public website) and on the /start page.
const { id, class: className } = Astro.props;
---

<!-- Shown only on the public website, where downloading cannot work. -->
      <section id={id} class:list={['card-khmer p-7 sm:p-10', className]}>
        <svg class="corner corner-tl" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#k-corner"></use></svg>
        <svg class="corner corner-tr" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#k-corner"></use></svg>
        <svg class="corner corner-bl" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#k-corner"></use></svg>
        <svg class="corner corner-br" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#k-corner"></use></svg>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-dark">
          Start here
          <span class="km font-moul text-base" lang="km">ចាប់ផ្តើមនៅទីនេះ</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          To save videos, you need the app on your own Windows computer. A website on the internet cannot do it. The app is free, and everyone can get it.
          <span class="km" lang="km">ដើម្បីរក្សាទុកវីដេអូ អ្នកត្រូវការកម្មវិធីលើកុំព្យូទ័រ Windows របស់អ្នកផ្ទាល់។ គេហទំព័រលើអ៊ីនធឺណិតមិនអាចធ្វើបានទេ។ កម្មវិធីឥតគិតថ្លៃ ហើយអ្នកគ្រប់គ្នាអាចទទួលបាន។</span>
        </p>
        <!-- The how-to video (silent, with English and Khmer captions). On wide screens it sits in the
             free space to the right of the card and stays in view while you scroll. On smaller screens
             it is inside the card, above the steps. It does not start by itself, to save mobile data. -->
        <div class="how-to-wrap">
          <figure class="how-to-video">
            <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster="/how-to-setup-poster.jpg" aria-label="Video: how to set up TikTok Saver">
              <source src="/how-to-setup.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
              Your browser cannot play this video.
            </video>
            <figcaption>
              <b>▶ Watch: how to set up</b> (about 1 minute)
              <span class="km" lang="km">មើល៖ របៀបរៀបចំ (ប្រហែល ១ នាទី)</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <ol class="mt-6 space-y-4">
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="step-chip">1</span>
            <p class="pt-1">
              Download the app with the button below. Then <b>unzip</b> it (right-click the file, then <b>Extract All</b>).
              <span class="km text-muted" lang="km">ទាញយកកម្មវិធីដោយប៊ូតុងខាងក្រោម។ បន្ទាប់មក <b>ពន្លាវា</b> (ចុចខាងស្តាំលើឯកសារ រួចជ្រើស <b>Extract All</b>)។</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="step-chip">2</span>
            <p class="pt-1">
              Install <b>Node.js</b> (free), one time only. Choose the "LTS" version.
              <span class="km text-muted" lang="km">ដំឡើង <b>Node.js</b> (ឥតគិតថ្លៃ) តែម្តងប៉ុណ្ណោះ។ ជ្រើសកំណែ "LTS"។</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="step-chip">3</span>
            <p class="pt-1">
              Open the unzipped folder and double-click <b>setup.bat</b> (one time only). It asks first. Then it downloads 2 free helper programs (about 215 MB) and puts a <b>TikTok Saver icon on your Desktop</b>.
              <span class="km text-muted" lang="km">បើកថតដែលបានពន្លា ហើយចុចពីរដងលើ <b>setup.bat</b> (តែម្តងប៉ុណ្ណោះ)។ វាសួរជាមុន។ បន្ទាប់មកវាទាញយកកម្មវិធីជំនួយឥតគិតថ្លៃ 2 (ប្រហែល 215 MB) ហើយដាក់ <b>រូបតំណាង TikTok Saver លើ Desktop</b> របស់អ្នក។</span>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="step-chip">4</span>
            <p class="pt-1">
              Double-click the <b>TikTok Saver</b> icon that setup put on your <b>Desktop</b> (or <b>start.bat</b>). Your browser opens your own page. Paste a link and press download.
              <span class="km text-muted" lang="km">ចុចពីរដងលើរូបតំណាង <b>TikTok Saver</b> ដែល setup បានដាក់លើ <b>Desktop</b> របស់អ្នក (ឬ <b>start.bat</b>)។ browser របស់អ្នកបើកទំព័រផ្ទាល់ខ្លួន។ បិទភ្ជាប់តំណ ហើយចុចទាញយក។</span>
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/lala80026051-cell/tiktok-saver/archive/refs/heads/main.zip"
            class="btn-main inline-block rounded-full px-7 py-3 font-semibold"
          >
            ⬇️ Download the app <span lang="km" class="font-khmer font-normal opacity-85">ទាញយកកម្មវិធី</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://nodejs.org" class="btn-alt inline-block rounded-full px-7 py-3 font-semibold">
            Get Node.js <span lang="km" class="font-khmer font-normal opacity-75">ទទួល Node.js</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">
          Works on Windows for now. Already installed? Then <a class="font-semibold text-brand underline" href="http://localhost:4323/">open your own page</a> (it works after you double-click start.bat).
          <span class="km" lang="km">ដំណើរការលើ Windows សម្រាប់ពេលនេះ។ ដំឡើងរួចហើយ? <a class="font-semibold text-brand underline" href="http://localhost:4323/">បើកទំព័រផ្ទាល់ខ្លួនរបស់អ្នក</a> (វាដំណើរការបន្ទាប់ពីអ្នកចុចពីរដងលើ start.bat)។</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">
          🙏 Only save your own videos, or videos where the owner says OK.
          <span class="km" lang="km">រក្សាទុកតែវីដេអូរបស់អ្នកផ្ទាល់ ឬវីដេអូដែលម្ចាស់អនុញ្ញាត។</span>
        </p>
      </section>

